sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Authorized internal user
    participant C as Controllers
    participant S as Services
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    U->>C: GetPricingExceptionHistoryAsync
    C->>S: GetRequestHistorySnapshotAsync
    S->>S: ExecuteAuthorizedRequestReadAsync
    S->>D: Read events, revisions and decisions
    D-->>U: Request history response via service and controller
    U->>C: GetApprovedDiscountForMortgageApplicationAsync
    C->>S: ApprovedDiscountService.GetAsync
    S->>S: UserService.GetUserWithRequiredRoleAsync
    S->>D: Join request to current revision and decision
    D-->>U: 200 approved discount or 404 via service and controller
